        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-08T21:14:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Skyscraper's very well kept secret is she's actually a set of triplets that all grew at different rates. When she \"changes sizes\", one of the sisters drops a smoke bomb and two of them quickly switch around. That's also why she tells everyone she does Sonic Damage. That way no one asks any questions when they hear a series of loud booms when Skycraper turns big. It's giant sister Skyscraper running up suddenly from 4 blocks over where she was crouching behind the football stadium.</p>",
